WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.010
‎THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.520
Next!

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:51.610
What’s with you? Are your legs injured?

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:02.410
Lady Loulan.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:07.880
I see.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:16.510
Episode 37: The Baths

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.930
What’s wrong, Xiaolan?

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:22.180
Know any good job openings?

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:23.600
Job openings?

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:24.640
Yeah.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:27.650
In six months,
my service in the rear palace will be up.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:32.360
A palace woman from a wealthy family
might receive a marriage proposal,

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.240
but that’s not the case for me.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.160
Maomao, got any connections?

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.660
Connections, huh?

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:44.120
Back when we first met,
Xiaolan was always gossiping.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.250
But now, as part of the first class
at the learning hall,

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.960
she’s dedicated to her studies.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:52.420
I hope she finds a good job
after leaving the rear palace.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.010
If I had to recommend somewhere…

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:55.930
You know a place?

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.260
Well, I guess I do, but…

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:02.140
The Verdigris House
in the pleasure district

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.690
welcomes young, charming,
and good-looking girls.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:09.520
Xiaolan still looks a bit youthful,
but her features aren’t bad.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.440
More importantly, her honest personality
makes her easy to train.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:16.030
Any experienced madam would want her.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:20.620
But working as a servant there
isn’t something you can suggest lightly.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:25.000
My connection is really a last resort.
Only if there’s no other choice.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.460
Eh? What’s that supposed to mean?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.290
Do you have anyone else you can rely on?

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:36.260
No good. If I ask Lord Jinshi,
Xiaolan might get caught up in some mess.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:37.590
-What’s going on?
-Oh!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.090
Oh! Shisui!

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:44.180
Hey, do you know any good job openings?

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.270
Why do you ask?

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:51.560
My service is ending soon, so I'm
looking for a job. Got any connections?

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:53.190
Well, I guess I could say I do.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.280
Really?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:57.530
Or rather, I could help you make one.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:03.790
The bathhouse?

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:08.410
There aren’t many people here
at this time.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:13.380
Bathhouses that use plenty of water
are exclusive to the wealthy.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.130
This one is large enough
to hold a thousand people at once,

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:21.140
with a main bath
that can fit several hundred.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:29.940
High-ranking consorts have private baths
in their palaces.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.730
This building has

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.070
small baths for mid-ranking consorts

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:39.070
and a large communal bath
for the palace maids.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:43.950
I used the bath at the Verdigris House
as if it were normal,

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:46.580
but commoners usually just
wipe themselves down with water.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:51.080
Just being able to bathe at all
is a privilege for palace maids.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.040
Shisui!

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.550
Hot! Too hot!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.680
Come on,

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:03.800
you know that early baths are always hot.

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:07.680
They gradually cool down
to the perfect temperature.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:12.270
I usually bathe later, so I didn’t know.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:13.690
Oh…

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.730
What? Maomao?

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.480
Well…

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:21.400
I just noticed that
you actually look slimmer in clothes.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.950
Where are you looking?

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:24.950
It’s a habit.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.080
Hey Shisui, that's not okay.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.540
You have to wash yourself properly
before getting in the bath.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.470
Maomao, can I have some of that too?

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:46.970
Go ahead.

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.640
-What is that?
-A medical office hair-washing agent.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.860
Want to try it, Xiaolan?

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:56.770
Yeah!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.450
Wah! It stings my eyes!

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.120
Close your eyes.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.670
She’s like a puppy.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.850
This area isn’t too hot.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.560
I think I’ll just stick to
wiping myself down with water.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:40.070
Really? It feels nice.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:45.610
Xiaolan grew up in a farming village,
so she’s not used to soaking in hot water.

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:48.830
Wiping down probably feels better for her.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.910
So, Shisui,
about that connection you mentioned…

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.620
Right!

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.630
This way, this way.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:05.170
No, we can’t!
This area is for consorts only!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.140
Can we really go in?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.350
It’s fine!

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:12.890
We’re allowed, plus the connection
I mentioned is just ahead.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.440
I see now.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:26.030
Excuse us.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.320
Oh? A new girl?

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:31.080
Yes! Looking forward to working with you.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:35.960
Here, this is fragrant oil.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.330
Please apply more pressure.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:40.170
Understood.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.130
Here, you two help too.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:44.090
Xiaolan, take this.

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:48.970
Alright, excuse me then.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.350
A little more to the right.

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:56.480
This consort probably
hasn’t been favored by the Emperor.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.480
If she had, she’d be wary of
letting an unfamiliar maid

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.360
touch her like this, in case of sabotage.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.330
I’ve seen enough women
at the pleasure district

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.410
to notice these things.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.710
I’m back.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:22.750
What’s that?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.210
Thread.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.590
What for?

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.800
You use it like this to remove hair,
by catching it in the thread.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.600
Would you like to try it?

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.520
Does it hurt?

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:44.190
It’s pretty painful,
but better than a dull razor.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.490
I’ll finish it by applying fragrant oil
to smooth the skin.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.030
I’ll see how it goes for now.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.370
When will you be back?

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.620
When would you like?

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.410
Maybe the day after tomorrow?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:05.630
I see. So this is how she gets close to
consorts she wouldn’t normally meet.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.050
This must be the "connection"
Shisui was talking about.

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:15.510
Massaging is surprisingly tiring.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.890
Yeah, a whole line formed
after you started.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.520
The maid who used to do it

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.230
finished her contract and left.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.070
You sure know a lot, Shisui.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:30.150
That maid was favored
by one of the consorts

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:33.570
and now works for her family.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:37.620
Oh! So that can happen too!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.580
Sometimes,

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:42.420
they even give us things they don’t
use anymore, like combs and necklaces.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.170
Wow!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:47.590
Even if it’s broken, if the material
is good, it can fetch a high price.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.340
Shisui sure is sharp.

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:54.090
But maids can only use the bathhouse
every other day.

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:58.220
If we start hanging around longer
just to massage consorts,

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.390
what will Hongniang say?

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.980
Alright! Time to find myself a connection!

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.150
Yeah!

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:12.530
Oh, massages in the bathhouse?

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:15.320
Yes, I was accompanying
an acquaintance who works there.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:21.330
Yeah, I know it’s not allowed. Understood.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.620
But isn’t it fine, Hongniang?

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:25.920
Lady Gyokuyou!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.790
In places like that, people relax

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.800
and unexpected conversations slip out.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.380
Gossip from the palace, for example.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.890
Maomao, if you hear any interesting
stories, do share them with me.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.350
You heard her!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.140
As expected of Lady Gyokuyou…

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.480
She's just as sharp as Shisui.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:50.610
True, there’s a lot of talk
floating around here.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.530
Rumors about Lady Gyokuyou’s pregnancy
had already spread.

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:57.660
They were even

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:00.870
speculating about the baby's gender
and the due date.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:06.080
Lately, whispers about Lady Lihua being
pregnant were also beginning to circulate,

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.380
but what caught my attention the most was

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:13.170
the rumor that Lady Loulan
might be pregnant too.

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:16.220
I can’t help but wonder…

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:19.510
You know how she always wears
those extravagant outfits?

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:22.890
But lately,
she’s been going out much less.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:27.140
And I heard she’s been wearing
looser clothing more often.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:31.020
It’s been over six months
since Lady Loulan arrived.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:35.360
As the daughter of
the esteemed official Shishou,

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.990
she was granted the rank of a high consort
with great fanfare.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:40.030
The Emperor couldn’t exactly ignore her.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.080
That would mean…

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:45.250
out of the four high consorts,
three are now pregnant.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:48.120
It’s something to celebrate,
but at the same time, a bit ominous.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.290
Hey.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:52.630
-Press a little harder on my legs.
-Yes!

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:56.220
That feels amazing!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.050
When are you coming next?

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.300
The day after tomorrow!

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.770
And then,

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.770
there’s one more rumor
that keeps popping up here.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:17.030
Oh, I wonder if he's there.

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:21.660
I heard there’s a handsome new eunuch!

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.910
I really want to see him.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.620
This sounds strangely familiar.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:29.960
I heard a rumor that 30 new eunuchs

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.960
have joined recently.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.500
New eunuchs?

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:36.300
But I thought they weren’t performing
the procedure anymore.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.050
They were slaves.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.760
Slaves? But I thought slavery had been
abolished in this country?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:44.050
They were likely foreign slaves.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:48.770
Some countries still castrate people
and turn them into slaves.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:52.100
Either they escaped, or they were rescued.

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:54.650
If there were 30 of them, that means

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:57.190
there must have been
a large-scale military operation.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:58.110
I see…

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:03.240
Shusui only ever seems
interested in insects,

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.780
but she’s actually pretty smart.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.410
The job of fetching bathwater

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.870
usually falls to the new eunuchs, right?

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:11.580
Is the rumored eunuch here?

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:13.290
But he’s a eunuch, you know?

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.750
But he’s good-looking, right?

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:19.380
Well, probably not as handsome
as Lord Jinshi, though.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.550
What’s wrong, Maomao?

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:23.800
Nothing…

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:25.050
Now that you mention it,

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.060
Maomao, you’re always with Lord Jinshi--

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.970
I run errands for the consorts.

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:38.690
Maomao?

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:41.700
Don’t think about it.
That was just a frog. Yes, a frog!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:45.910
Is that…?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.790
Why is Lady Lishu here?

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:01.010
I feel like I'm being glared at.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:06.350
You're on a break, aren't you?
Why not have some?

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.230
I have a question.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:18.860
How did you come to serve
in the Jade Pavilion?

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:20.820
Well, if you ask how…

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:25.660
I became a poison taster
due to staff shortage at Jade Pavilion.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.290
I heard that already.
What I want to know is

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.540
why the ever-suspicious

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.420
Gyokuyou trusts you.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.500
Sister!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.750
So she's close enough to call
Lady Gyokuyou by her name.

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:44.510
In that case, it's natural to be
wary of a suspicious palace woman.

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.180
I'm just a poison taster.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:51.890
If someone tries to poison Lady Gyokuyou,
I'll be the first to die.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:55.850
If you see me as nothing more than that,
it should put your mind at ease.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:00.520
I’d heard about you, but you really are
straightforward, aren’t you?

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.990
-Oh. Thank you.
-And…

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.200
it seems you have quite a few friends
outside the palace.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.120
You might want to rein it in a little.

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.290
If a senior palace woman spends

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:14.250
all her time outside the rear palace,
the newer ones will start feeling lonely,

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.620
don’t you think?

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.830
Especially our youngest, Seki-u,

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.380
she’s the same age as you.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.840
That's true.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:27.300
Lately, I've been hanging out mostly
with Shisui and Xiaolan.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:30.970
Excessive wandering by a poison taster
can be suspicious.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.310
In that case, why don’t we go
to the bathhouse together today?

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:38.190
The bathhouse?

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:42.070
Sounds like a good idea.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:45.990
Seki-u, it wouldn't hurt for you to
spend time with people outside our circle.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.660
But Sister Haku-u!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.450
You're going because Lady Gyokuyou
ordered it, right?

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:52.370
That’s right.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.740
Sister Koku-u!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.580
Just think of it as part of your duty.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.080
What?!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.960
Oh, wow.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:06.630
So this is Maomao’s friend?

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:09.220
My, my!

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:12.390
Who are these people?

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:14.180
They're harmless. Probably.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.390
Today shouldn’t be too bad.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:20.350
More girls have joined in
to do massages lately.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:21.360
Oh?

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:25.400
Yeah. Some girls saw others getting combs
as gifts and got interested.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:30.160
So the ones who were doing it before
were just good at keeping it under wraps.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.740
Lady Seki-u, aren't you going to change?

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:35.620
Of course I am!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.290
Huh?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.290
What is this?!

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.290
No way!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.300
Um…

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.630
Is this… all I’m supposed to wear?

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:50.880
Yup.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:52.890
It’s hot inside anyway.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:55.350
No need to be shy!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.020
-Oh!
-Oh…

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.600
You look just fine!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.560
What do you mean, "fine"?

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:04.570
Modesty is more important!

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.320
Looks live we’ve got a defiant one.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:13.160
If you're this embarrassed,
how have you managed until now?

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:16.540
My sisters use this big bath, but…

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.370
I asked Lady Gyokuyou

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:21.620
if I could use the palace bath.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.540
In the western regions, we don’t bathe
as often because of the desert climate.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:29.300
Well, you'll get over the embarrassment
soon enough.

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:38.930
The hair removal is done.
Please apply the scented oil, Lady Seki-u.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.560
Lady Seki-u, over here too!

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.350
Yes!

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.400
You can rub it on, right?

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.400
Rub it on?

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:51.860
Yes, slather it on
like you would with chicken.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:55.410
It’ll help them relax
and loosen their tongue.

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:57.490
Got it.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:03.960
Alright, I will now begin the massage.

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.380
That’s…

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.390
Lady Lishu?

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:21.020
I saw her here last time too.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:23.980
If a consort comes to this bathhouse,

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.360
won’t it make everyone uneasy?

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.650
Are you alright, Lady Lishu?

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.900
Yes, Kanan.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:35.360
Oh boy…

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:38.910
I was thinking she should have
more capable maids,

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:43.040
but then again, none of her maids
are particularly competent to begin with.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:44.920
Well, I guess

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.750
it means she won’t intimidate anyone.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:51.340
Lady Lishu is only 15.
Though she holds a high rank,

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.760
the Emperor doesn’t visit her chambers.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.720
She’s still just a timid young princess.

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:00.140
-Take my hand.
-Ah, thank you--

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.640
She's looking at me like
I’m some kind of monster again.

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.600
I wish she’d get used to me already.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.280
A razor burn?

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.280
Um, Lady Lishu.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.860
Yes?

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:17.990
Would you like to try
a new hair removal method?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.580
Um…

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.500
Lady Lishu!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.130
Alright, please lie down here.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.300
Lady Lishu!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.300
What is a high-ranking consort doing here?

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:38.300
Don’t worry.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.310
I’ll be gentle.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.620
You're all done.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.910
Thank you.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:10.130
All done.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:14.340
I’ve applied the scented oil as well,
so there shouldn’t be much irritation.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.840
I see.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:19.930
Is Lady Lishu
not used to this kind of thing?

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:22.050
Well, not really.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.850
In the Diamond Pavilion, um…

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:28.020
No one really cares about details.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:30.650
And before that, she was a nun.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.020
Oh, right.

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.530
Lady Lishu was married off

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:40.610
to the previous Emperor as a
political pawn when she was just a child.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:44.120
After he passed, she became a nun,

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.700
only to be reinstated as a consort
and brought back to the rear palace.

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.710
Looking at it that way,
she’s had a rather unfortunate life.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:57.630
Maybe it’s a good thing her former
poison taster ended up as her head maid.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:01.590
Since we’re at it… How about you?

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.640
No thank you!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:06.140
Um…

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:08.680
Thank you.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.730
If you’d like,

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:12.690
I could offer you some chilled juice.

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:14.310
Yay!

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:23.070
Yum!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:32.960
By the way, Lady Lishu,
why did you come to the public bathhouse?

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.840
The Diamond Pavilion
should have its own bath.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.090
Well…

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:45.100
There’s…

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:54.860
There’s a ghost…

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.030
in that palace bathhouse!

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:10.160
A ghost?

00:23:46.050 --> 00:24:00.930
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.930
Next episode: The Dancing Ghost

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
